TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 844545726}
  m_Text: 'PHYSICAL ENHANCEMENT EXAM

    When clouds break, a spark wakes.

    When
    the flame dies, water remains.

    Three runes guard a strength spell.

    After
    the stone rises, seek the sea.'
